    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d10">

                <pb facs="0119" n="7" sameAs="frus:frus1910/pg7"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">President Taft to the President of the Argentine
                        Republic.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >The White House</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1910-05-25"><hi rendition="#italic">May 25,
                        1910</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>In the name of the Government and people of the United States and in my own I
                    send cordial felicitations on this centennial anniversary of the birth of your
                    great nation. The United States of America has observed with sympathetic
                    interest the marvelous development of the Argentine Republic, not only in
                    material things, but in the highest aims of nations, and it is our hearty wish
                    that this sister Republic of the south may ever flourish and prosper. I also
                    offer to Your Excellency personally the assurance of my own high regard and good
                    wishes.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Wm. H. Taft.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
